A||N||3||AusFiero||Steering Wheel Spline Compatability||||5||
Z||000000||AusFiero||03-18-2001||06:01 PM||||Does anyone know if any japanese cars boss kits to mount an aftermarket steering wheel are the same pattern as a Fiero ?<P>Being in Australia I cannnot get a Fiero boss kit but japanese cars are abundant. <P>Alternatively and probably more expensive for me is buying an aftermarket wheel from the US complete with boss kit. Can't even use a US boss kit on our local wheels as the local standard bolt pattern on the wheels is different.<P>If a jap one won't fit, does anyone know a good online store in the US with a good range of steering wheel?<P>What should i expect to pay US for a decent aftermarket steering wheel?<P>Does anyone need an excellent condition 1986 GT steering wheel?||||reg||5
Z||000001||MrPBody||03-18-2001||06:39 PM||||I think a Grant 3196 adapter fits most GM including Fiero, but may only work with a Grant wheel.  See  <A HREF="http://www.grantproducts.com/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.grantproducts.com/</A> .  Grant probably is the most common US wheel.  I don't know if this helps you in the Antipodes.<P>Discount autoparts stores including AutoZone ( <A HREF="http://www.autozone.com/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.autozone.com/</A> ) sell Grant wheels.  Would they ship to Australia?  I don't know.<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000002||rockcrawl||03-19-2001||08:32 PM||||Summit racing Equipment has a pretty good selection of Grant and Autotechnica wheels, and they ship overseas for an additional $24. <A HREF="http://www.summitracing.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.summitracing.com</A>  They show more wheels in the print catalog than they do online.||||reg||1
Z||000003||AusFiero||03-20-2001||05:01 PM||||Problem solved. After disassembling the Fiero GT steering wheel I have discovered I can make an adapter plate to fit an Australian bolt pattern wheel to the original Fiero Boss Kit. <BR>A reasonably easy and extremely cheap fix in the end.<BR>That looks strange. Not often we get to put the words Fiero and Cheap together in the same sentence in Australia.<P><BR>||||reg||14
